  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO UN Environment 2015 GVA/Kenya Minamata/DELC GB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JPO UN Environment 2015 GVA/Kenya Minamata/DELC GB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen riktar sig mot Agenda 2030 m&#xe5;let 13: Bek&#xe4;mpa klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar. Den tematiska inriktningen &#xe4;r milj&#xf6;/klimat med fokus p&#xe5; styrning av kemikalier och avfallshantering. JPO-tj&#xe4;nsten &#xe4;r vald i samarbete med Sida och Milj&#xf6;departmentet och UNEP. Tj&#xe4;nstens tematiska inneb&#xf6;rd &#xe4;r v&#xe4;l vald av Sida. Framtida karri&#xe4;rm&#xe4;jligheter inom Chemicals-omr&#xe5;det borde finnas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO program (Junior Professional Officers) is an important part of the total Swedish focus on increased Swedish participation in         international organizations. The program offers young graduates the  opportunity to serve in the UN and other international organizations.The position is addressing the Agenda 2030 goal 13: Climate Action. Thematic area is environment/climate with a focus on governing of chemicals and waste management.</narrative>
  </description>
